<TextPageLayout title="Contact" description="How to reach SifterSearch: ask Anís, write to anis@oceanlibrary.com, or support the project.">
  <p>SifterSearch is a small, independent project. The quickest way to an answer is usually to ask.</p>
  <h2>Questions about the library or a passage</h2>
  <p>Ask <strong>Anís</strong>, our research companion — the chat button at the bottom right of every page — or write to
    <strong>anis@oceanlibrary.com</strong>. Letters are answered by Anís and read by a person.</p>
  <h2>Corrections, missing texts and contributions</h2>
  <p>Found a typo, a wrong attribution, or a work we should hold? Write to <strong>anis@oceanlibrary.com</strong> with the
    title, a link or a photo of the title page; it reaches the people who keep the library.</p>
  <h2>Supporting the project</h2>
  <p>See <a href="/support">Support SifterSearch</a>.</p>
</TextPageLayout>
